{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">由羅嘉良、楊茜堯、陳煒、張曦雯等主演的《模範律師團》目前正於深圳密鑼緊鼓地拍攝中。<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">據TVB娛樂新聞台獨家報道，</span>TVB行政主席許濤日前特意親赴劇組探班，了解演員工作環境與拍劇進度，並主動與眾人融洽相處，讓緊湊緊張的拍攝現場變得輕鬆愉快。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">探班期間，羅嘉良即興建議許濤飾演法官或律師，同場的陳煒與楊茜堯亦深表認同，指對方是全場最有威嚴的一位。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"5d14bba0-1ac0-4eb2-9b73-43b523e620e6.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026G6ziXeKp4I1784789435.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"5d14bba0-1ac0-4eb2-9b73-43b523e620e6.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"image-caption\" style=\"padding: 8px 12px; background: rgb(245, 247, 250); border-top: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(96, 98, 102); line-height: 1.5;\">\n<span class=\"img-description\">TVB娛樂新聞台</span>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p id=\"p-rc_c79665304844c65f-37\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">羅嘉良與楊茜堯相隔多年再度合作，兩人均表示默契依舊，羅嘉良笑言劇集雖然嚴肅，但鏡頭背後完全不同。</p><p id=\"p-rc_c79665304844c65f-37\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><p id=\"p-rc_c79665304844c65f-37\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">楊茜堯更爆料指「師傅」私下其實是個童心未泯、完全像個小朋友的小頑童。陳煒與張曦雯則大讚羅嘉良待人隨和親切，<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">張曦雯更笑言若是隔了一段時間沒在片場見到對方，甚至會心生挂念。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_c79665304844c65f-37\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><p id=\"p-rc_c79665304844c65f-37\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -webkit-standard;\">而在接受訪問期間，何廣沛與劉佩玥同樣再次親眼目睹羅嘉良貪玩活潑的一面，激讚這位大前輩風趣幽默，與戲裡的嚴肅形象截然不同。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_c79665304844c65f-37\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"e837719e-eb10-4405-a808-48a4c206a5e6.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026wo6UfpnMSf1784789439.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"e837719e-eb10-4405-a808-48a4c206a5e6.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"image-caption\" style=\"padding: 8px 12px; background: rgb(245, 247, 250); border-top: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(96, 98, 102); line-height: 1.5;\">\n<span class=\"img-description\">TVB娛樂新聞台</span>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-23T14:19:20.838959+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":385,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}